      "byte_boundary_case": "password_bytes_boundary_rejects_coercion_without_mutation",
      "lifecycle_case": "password_unicode_nul_roundtrip_and_change_preserve_exact_bytes",
      "scope": "Strict Unicode-scalar text adapter rejects malformed UTF-16 before Worker transport; raw WASM and Worker APIs require Uint8Array and preserve arbitrary octets. Golden text output, malformed IDs and lifecycle IDs must match the shared fixture."
